TEST-ONLY KEY. NOT A SECRET. NEVER REGISTER THIS KEY IN A REAL TRUST STORE.

This Ed25519 private key is published in the AlixAI repository on purpose so
that fixtures, reference apps and tests can sign application packages.
Anyone can sign with it, so it proves nothing about who made a package.
internal/trust refuses to register it unless the store is opened with
trust.AllowTestOnlyKeys, which only tests and developer tools do.
It is derived from the seed phrase in tools/devkeys/devkeys.go, and the
test in this directory checks that this file still matches.

Key ID:     alixai-test-only-publisher
